  <DialogueName>k__BackingField: TalkWithSomeEssence
  <Text>k__BackingField: I see you have already recovered some of the <style=Engine>sky
    essence</style>, most excellent! Yet the <style=Engine>essence engine</style>
    is not yet fully restored, and the path ahead remains broken. Recover the rest,
    and the path itself shall recover with it.
  <LocalizedKey>k__BackingField: LOCAL_DIALOG_KEY
  <Choices>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: I'll get the rest.
